Inicializar la Jetson de Marvin-------------------------------------
Conectarse por medio de wifi a Marvin_Net
ssh marvin@10.42.0.1

Emparejar la hora:
sudo date -s "2026-06-17 12:18:20"

Emparejar palanca:
sudo bluetoothctl
power on
agent on
default-agent
pair [MAC]
trust [MAC]
connect [MAC]

Actualizar Código de Marvin (Afuera del docker)---------------------
cd marvin
git pull origin main
# Actualizar dockerfile(Si hay cambios):
cd /marvin
# Reconstruir Docker (puede tomar 5-10 minutos)
./setup_jetson.sh
sudo docker build . -t marvin:latest

./setup_laptop.sh
Iniciar Docker------------------------------------------------------

sudo docker run -it --net=host \
  --privileged \
  --env="NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all" \
  --runtime nvidia \
  -v /tmp/argus_socket:/tmp/argus_socket \
  -v /dev:/dev \
  marvin:latest /bin/bash

Ejecutar código de ROS2 de Marvin------------------------------------
colcon build
Abrir otra terminal docker:
sudo docker ps
sudo docker exec -it 0a5c431baa59 /bin/bash

colcon build --packages-select marvincar_bringup marvincar_vision

Launch base marvin:
source install/setup.bash
export ROS_DOMAIN_ID=1
ros2 launch marvincar_bringup marvincar_bringup_launch.py 

Correr lidar marvin:
source install/setup.bash
export ROS_DOMAIN_ID=1
ros2 launch marvin_lidar ld19.launch.py

Correr mapeado marvin:
source install/setup.bash
export ROS_DOMAIN_ID=1
ros2 launch marvincar_nav mapping_launch.py  


